WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.037
Brad: That was close.

2
00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:21.665
Tina: A little too close, if you ask me.

3
00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:24.586
Danny: It looks like we’re stuck again.

4
00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:27.240
Now what are we going to do?

5
00:00:27.241 --> 00:00:30.665
Danny: We’ll never get to Ginormous from here.

6
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:35.457
Brad: Ginormous! What about getting home?

7
00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:37.152
Danny: We can’t go home.

8
00:00:37.153 --> 00:00:39.403
You promised to help.

9
00:00:39.404 --> 00:00:43.316
Brad: I didn’t know we would end up trapped on a cliff!

10
00:00:43.317 --> 00:00:47.036
Tina: Oh, Brad! We need to help the giants.

11
00:00:47.037 --> 00:00:51.039
Tina: Imagine living in a world without color.

12
00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:53.615
Brad: Sure, that would be terrible.

13
00:00:53.616 --> 00:00:56.384
But why is it my problem?

14
00:00:56.385 --> 00:01:00.945
Danny: Because you can help, that’s why.

15
00:01:00.946 --> 00:01:03.679
Brad: I guess you’re right.

16
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.930
Tina: Brad is right about one thing, though.

17
00:01:06.931 --> 00:01:08.897
Danny: What’s that?

18
00:01:08.898 --> 00:01:14.474
Tina: We are trapped on a cliff.

19
00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:15.928
Danny: Wait a minute.

20
00:01:15.929 --> 00:01:17.973
I’ve got an idea.

21
00:01:17.974 --> 00:01:21.655
Brad: What is it?

22
00:01:21.656 --> 00:01:27.239
Danny: See? We can use these to climb back up to the top.

23
00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:31.449
Tina: Great idea, Danny!

24
00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:35.091
Brad: Wow, that’s a long way.

25
00:01:35.092 --> 00:01:39.519
Tina: I didn’t realize we had fallen so far.

26
00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:43.400
Tina: I think it’s less scary if we climb down.

27
00:01:43.401 --> 00:01:45.714
Danny: It does look shorter.

28
00:01:45.715 --> 00:01:51.343
Brad: Either way, it’s not going to be easy.

29
00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:56.380
Tina: Let’s go for it!

30
00:01:56.381 --> 00:01:58.732
Danny: How are you guys doing?

31
00:01:58.733 --> 00:02:02.750
Tina: Not bad. These suction cups work great.

32
00:02:02.751 --> 00:02:08.179
Brad: It’s not as fun as the water slide, though.

33
00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.997
Danny: I think the rock is wetter here.

34
00:02:10.998 --> 00:02:14.064
Brad: It’s spray from the waterfall and the river.

35
00:02:14.065 --> 00:02:16.994
Brad: It means we’re getting closer to the bottom.

36
00:02:16.995 --> 00:02:21.378
Tina: It shouldn’t be much farther.

37
00:02:21.379 --> 00:02:24.753
Danny: I think my suction cups are slipping.

38
00:02:24.754 --> 00:02:27.075
Brad: The rocks are too slippery.

39
00:02:27.076 --> 00:02:29.687
Mine are slipping too.

40
00:02:29.688 --> 00:02:31.740
Tina: Let’s hurry up.

41
00:02:31.741 --> 00:02:34.713
Danny: Faster, everyone!

42
00:02:34.714 --> 00:02:36.393
Tina: Hold on!

43
00:02:36.394 --> 00:02:38.579
Danny: We’re going to fall!

44
00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:44.712
Brad: Oh no!
